                                                                                
 Usage: opentide info [OPTIONS] [section] [name]                                
                                                                                
 Show repository and platform information                                       
                                                                                
╭─ Arguments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│   section      <str>                                                         │
│   name         <str>  Vocabulary to inspect, with the vocab section (e.g.    │
│                       surface)                                               │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --platform         PLATFORM  Detection platform: sentinel, splunk,           │
│                              crowdstrike, defender_for_endpoint,             │
│                              sentinel_one, carbon_black_cloud, harfanglab,   │
│                              elastic, sysdig                                 │
│ --technique        <str>     ATT&CK technique ID for the coverage section    │
│                              (T1059)                                         │
│ --strict                     Exit non-zero when any object failed to load    │
│ --help                       Show this message and exit.                     │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide info
   $ opentide info --platform sentinel
